{"id":"vod_sn_36317","vodId":"36317","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"森林好小子","name_cn":"森林好小子","date":"1988-01-01","year":"1988","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/704e303132bf552761e45835a034c3bc.jpg"},"summary":"自幼在森林里长大的男孩卡内奇跟随抚养他的爷爷生活，他得到爷爷真传，性格单纯，武功高强，加上同样身世不明的女孩嘉惠以及狼族好哥们儿福利霸，卡内奇的生活无忧无虑。偶然机缘，他意外重逢了失散13年之久的家人，顺理成章卡内奇也回到位于大都市的家中生活。秃头老爹、懦弱老弟还有可爱的妹妹，古哈一家增添了不少的麻烦与乐趣。等到了学校后，围绕卡内奇各种各样的乐事继续升级，大恶人西多、帅到爆的成大龙、超级自恋的洛基，一群智商与情商都有问题的家伙点缀着卡内奇从未体验过的校园生活……　　本片根据佐藤正创作连载于集英社周刊《少年Jump》的漫画作品《燃烧吧！大哥》改编，剧情中人名均以国内流通的版本为准。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LRbSwMtF3H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yrZThs3vJg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3KLeQL1uzY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/981pP9j8uc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DqLZRpYAq61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NNrJykeG721/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vrNneSaN8a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cLLEnjJcxz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UiNQv4bBq41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bmNwfw3PBq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aWc03XxxpP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Cc5JUn5ZAp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ps5dBz7LVE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TGWcq5duHN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name"